{"v":1,"id":"r1#1","at":"2026-11-05T11:26:42.440Z","kind":"engine.transition","source":{"system":"harness","ref":"return toolu_01Gv1ytJDRCUpf4y1TVFPHUW"},"session":"de046873-14f4-4e57-bf02-56c8bd1190f1","item":"r1","state":"\"building\"","release":"0.1.0","payload":{"transition":"r1#1","seq":1,"outcome":"applied","reason":null,"workflow":"quick-fix@cb8645f40db0d2d76fa69227eb78f07668175817e6a2a2a7b5b5eb83d06bbda0","event":{"type":"xstate.done.actor.brief","output":{"builder":"1. Open math.js at the repository root (create it only if it does not exist) and read how existing functions are exported (ES module `export` or CommonJS `module.exports`); follow that same style.\n2. Add a function clamp(x, lo, hi) that returns lo if x < lo, hi if x > hi, otherwise x. Equivalent: Math.min(Math.max(x, lo), hi).\n3. Export it from math.js using the file's existing export style, keeping all existing exports intact.\n4. Confirm by loading math.js (import or require, matching its style) and checking that clamp is a function and that clamp(5,0,10)===5, clamp(-1,0,10)===0, clamp(11,0,10)===10.\n5. Make one pull request containing the change. Reference issue https://github.com/o/r/issues/9 in the description.","verifier":"Check 1 - expect line: \"clamp is exported from math.js\".\nAt the PR head, run a script from a directory other than the repo that loads math.js by absolute path, using the style that matches the file (dynamic import() for an ES module, require for CommonJS), and prints typeof of the exported `clamp`. Also call clamp(5,0,10), clamp(-1,0,10), clamp(11,0,10).\nPASS: the module loads and its export `clamp` is a function.\nFAIL: the module fails to load, or `clamp` is not exported from math.js, or is not a function.\n\nAdvisory (not part of PASS or FAIL): the calls should return 5, 0, 10 respectively; existing exports of math.js should still work; the PR should reference issue 9."}},"run":"r1:0.brief","from":"\"briefing\"","hash":"b0b4671b9428","writes":[{"path":"briefs","from":"event.output","set":"/states/briefing/invoke/onDone/actions/0"}]}}
